{"4653610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bar Simulator", "steam_appid": 4653610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/6b2ed184684e8e19130194c5f59ae87c.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=282 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/6b2ed184684e8e19130194c5f59ae87c.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/6b2ed184684e8e19130194c5f59ae87c.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix cocktails. Handle the chaos. Pay your debt.<br><br>Build your bar empire… but every night comes at a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bar. Your rules. Your profit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/1ba3ee779f10aff884fb3bfb204f282c.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=264 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/1ba3ee779f10aff884fb3bfb204f282c.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/1ba3ee779f10aff884fb3bfb204f282c.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders, mix drinks, and serve customers.<br><br>As the crowd grows, mistakes become costly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ce367c4512fac69f1075d4ae03784ba8.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=260 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ce367c4512fac69f1075d4ae03784ba8.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ce367c4512fac69f1075d4ae03784ba8.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare the right drink — fast.<br><br>Keep customers happy.<br><br>Earn tips… or lose. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c2d5f99e5d399257cdb23517a9884e29.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=480 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c2d5f99e5d399257cdb23517a9884e29.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c2d5f99e5d399257cdb23517a9884e29.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/f409dd3d8591252fa61bb925fe9f7c17.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=256 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/f409dd3d8591252fa61bb925fe9f7c17.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/f409dd3d8591252fa61bb925fe9f7c17.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You made a deal with a demonic entity to open your bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your debt<br>or</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the assigned task</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the wrong drinks.<br>Create chaos on purpose.<br>When necessary… make someone disappear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don’t get caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ab1756e610776d4ae16b72019a3fff4c.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=258 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ab1756e610776d4ae16b72019a3fff4c.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/ab1756e610776d4ae16b72019a3fff4c.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to grow your bar.<br><br>More customers, more money, more chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c90b00eb72c3f0654189ecd8d4a9e626.poster.avif?t=1787169109\" width=252 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c90b00eb72c3f0654189ecd8d4a9e626.webm?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653610/extras/c90b00eb72c3f0654189ecd8d4a9e626.mp4?t=1787169109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a clean and organized bar…<br>or sometimes, do the exact opposite. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"h